el at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to create vector tiles. The default value is 0."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","type":"topic"}}}